@startuml UC-01: Login dan Logout

title UC-01: Login dan Logout\nSistem Smart Aquaponic

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C7BE5
    ActorBorderColor #2C7BE5
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C7BE5
    ParticipantBorderColor #2C7BE5
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #EBF4FF
    ActorBackgroundColor #EBF4FF
    GroupBackgroundColor #F0F4FF
    GroupBorderColor #ADC8FF
}

actor       "User / Admin"        as User
boundary    "LoginPage (UI)"      as UI
control     "AuthController"      as AC
entity      "Users <<database>>"  as DB
entity      "Session <<database>>" as Session

== Skenario Utama: Login Berhasil ==

User  ->  UI      : Buka halaman /login
activate UI
UI   -->  User    : Tampilkan form login (email, password)
deactivate UI

User  ->  UI      : Submit form (email, password)
activate UI
UI    ->  AC      : POST /login {email, password}
activate AC

' Validasi format input
AC    ->  AC      : validate(email: required|email,\npassword: required)

alt Validasi Format Gagal
    AC   -->  UI  : redirect back() with validation errors
    UI   -->  User : Tampilkan pesan error (field kosong / format salah)
else Validasi Format Berhasil
    AC    ->  DB  : Auth::attempt({email, password})
    activate DB
    DB    ->  DB  : Cari user berdasarkan email\nBandingkan hash password (bcrypt)
    DB   -->  AC  : User ditemukan / tidak ditemukan
    deactivate DB

    alt Kredensial Salah
        AC   -->  UI  : redirect back()->withErrors(['email' => 'Email atau password salah'])
        UI   -->  User : Tampilkan error "Email atau password salah"
    else Kredensial Valid
        AC    ->  Session : session()->regenerate()\nBuat session baru (anti session fixation)
        activate Session
        Session -->  AC   : Session ID baru
        deactivate Session
        AC   -->  UI  : redirect('/dashboard')
        deactivate AC
        UI   -->  User : Arahkan ke halaman Dashboard
    end
end

deactivate UI

== Skenario: Logout ==

User  ->  UI      : Klik tombol Logout
activate UI
UI    ->  AC      : POST /logout
activate AC
AC    ->  AC      : Auth::logout()\nHapus data autentikasi user dari session
AC    ->  Session : session()->invalidate()\nsession()->regenerateToken()
activate Session
Session -->  AC   : Session lama dihapus, token baru dibuat
deactivate Session
AC   -->  UI      : redirect('/login')
deactivate AC
UI   -->  User    : Arahkan ke halaman Login
deactivate UI

@enduml
